Normal
  h j k l       move left/down/up/right (arrow keys also work)
  0 $ w b e     line and word motions
  g G %         file start/end and matching brace
  N motion      count prefix repeats a motion (also n, u, U)
  N g / N G     go to line N
  N d           delete N lines
  i I a A       enter Insert mode
  o O           open line below/above
  x dd yy p     delete, delete line, yank line, paste
  d motion      delete over the next motion
  v V           character/line Visual mode
  u U           undo/redo
  / n           search/search next
  :             Command mode
  r             replace with the next typed key (Escape cancels)
  Ctrl-N        toggle file explorer (Escape closes it)

Insert
  Escape        return to Normal
  arrows        move and split insertion history
  Tab           insert the configured indentation
  Backspace     delete byte before cursor
  Enter         newline plus brace-depth indentation

Visual
  motions       extend selection (h j k l 0 $ w b e g G % and arrows)
  d/x y         delete or yank
  > <           indent or unindent selected rows
